[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16140.229, "timestamp": "04:29:00", "text": "もの。そんなことはしないでください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16141.99, "timestamp": "04:29:01", "text": "それはまずい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16144.389, "timestamp": "04:29:04", "text": "私たちは手に入れます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16147.59, "timestamp": "04:29:07", "text": "プラットフォームとは、どのようなプラットフォームかということです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16150.07, "timestamp": "04:29:10", "text": "例えばYouTubeには独自のルールがあり、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16150.964, "timestamp": "04:29:10", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "gfx people?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16152.229, "timestamp": "04:29:12", "text": "規制ですよね？プラットフォームがあります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16155.51, "timestamp": "04:29:15", "text": "正しい利用規約ですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16157.67, "timestamp": "04:29:17", "text": "Twitchには独自のTOCがあり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16160.79, "timestamp": "04:29:20", "text": "そういうことばかり。 GFX の人々は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16162.089, "timestamp": "04:29:22", "author": "@mattmeownster", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_k0PVo4Ayjzf9FlRcdjZAQYBwK430_hLvWlP9jgikQjC65W-ONDWjkk4dykteuHJ96HgQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "terms of service"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16163.91, "timestamp": "04:29:23", "text": "人々に使用される用語"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16164.612, "timestamp": "04:29:24", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "what gfx? like rtx?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16166.309, "timestamp": "04:29:26", "text": "えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16169.83, "timestamp": "04:29:29", "text": "自分自身のように強制するために"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16171.67, "timestamp": "04:29:31", "text": "自己宣伝"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16176.07, "timestamp": "04:29:36", "text": "彼らは芸術などをしていて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16178.55, "timestamp": "04:29:38", "text": "彼らに依頼することを強制するようなもの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16181.11, "timestamp": "04:29:41", "text": "あるいは、あなたに懇願するあらゆるもの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16184.149, "timestamp": "04:29:44", "text": "彼らに委託するなど、それは良くないことです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16186.389, "timestamp": "04:29:46", "text": "これはスパム詐欺と見なされる可能性があり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16188.469, "timestamp": "04:29:48", "text": "もの。詐欺に遭う人がいる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16190.389, "timestamp": "04:29:50", "text": "人々"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16192.95, "timestamp": "04:29:52", "text": "えーと、詐欺に遭った人たちは、たとえ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16195.11, "timestamp": "04:29:55", "text": "あなたのために依頼をします、それは素晴らしいでしょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16197.83, "timestamp": "04:29:57", "text": "低品質で全てがそうで、"}]